          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಸಾಬೀತುಪಡಿಸು — sābītupaḍisu — \"to prove\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ನನ್ನ ಮಾತು ನಿಜ ಅಂತ ನಾನು ಸಾಬೀತುಪಡಿಸಿದೆ. nanna mātu nija anta nānu sābītupaḍiside. I proved that my words were true."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (I …): ಸಾಬೀತುಪಡಿಸಿದೆ, sābītupaḍiside."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಸಾಬೀತು means proved; -ಪಡಿಸು makes a verb of it. ಸಾಬೀತಾಯಿತು, it was proved."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಸಾಬೀತುಪಡಿಸು (sābītupaḍisu) is a loan from Hindustani sābit, \"proved, established\", which comes from Arabic thābit, \"firm\", with the Kannada ending -paḍisu that makes a verb."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
