          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಸಾಧ್ಯತೆ (sādhyate) is borrowed from Sanskrit sādhyatā, \"feasibility\" (Monier-Williams), built on sādhya, \"that can be done\", with the ending -tā, \"-ness\"."
